{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"cat > /workspace/artifacts/flag_audit.md << 'AUDIT_EOF'\n# Flag Reachability Audit — v1-clean-baseline\n\n## Scope: preview rollout controls in this workspace copy.\n\n## Flags\n\n### ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW — \"'`live`\n\n- **Parser**: present in `src/preview/config.py` (`load_preview_env`). Sets `shadow_enabled=True` and `effective_mode=\"shadow\"`.\n- **Runtime reachable**: yes. `src/preview/runtime.py` (`preview_runtime_branch`) checks `config.shadow_enabled` and returns `\"preview_runtime_branch:shadow_preview_path\"`.\n- **Test**: `tests/test_shadow_preview_live.py` verifies parser hit and runtime branch.\n- **Config default**: `config/defaults.toml` — `enable_shadow_preview = false`.\n- **Disproved false-positive path**: Parser hit alone does not prove reachability (per `docs/false_positive_notes.md`), but the explicit `if config.shadow_enabled` guard in `runtime.py` confirms the branch is reachable at runtime.\n\n### ENABLE_PREVIEW_V2 — `live-alias`\n\n- **Parser**: present in `src/preview/config.py` (`load_preview_env`). Normalizes to the same shadow path as `ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW`.\n- **Runtime reachable**: yes, but only as an alias — not a standalone branch.\n- **Test**: `tests/test_preview_v2_alias.py` verifies the alias mapping.\n- **Config default**: `config/defaults.toml` — `enable_preview_v2 = false`.\n- **Disproved false-positive path**: Parser presence and test coverage could suggest a standalone flag, but the runbook (`docs/preview_rollout_runbook.md`) and parser_hits mapping confirm it normalizes to `ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW` and is not a standalone runtime branch.\n\n### PREVIEW_FORCE_LEGACY — `dead`\n\n- **Parser**: present in `src/preview/config.py` (`load_preview_env`). Sets `force_legacy_seen=True`.\n- **Runtime reachable**: no. `src/preview/runtime.py` does not inspect `force_legacy_seen`; the only consumer is `src/preview/legacy.py` (`legacy_force_label`) which produces a reporting string.\n- **Test**: `tests/test_force_legacy_reporting_only.py` verifies parser hit and legacy label, but confirms `branch` stays on `legacy_preview_path`.\n- **Config default**: `config/defaults.toml` — `preview_force_legacy = false`.\n- **Disproved false-positive path**: Parser hit and test exist, but the live service (`preview_runtime_branch`) does not branch on this flag. The runbook explicitly states it is \"left in reporting and operator notes only.\"\n\n## Summary Table\n\n| Flag                    | Classification | Parser | Runtime Reachable | Standalone Branch | Alias Of              |\n|-------------------------|---------------|--------|-----------------------|-----------------------|\n| ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW   | live              | yes  | yes                   | —                     |\n| ENABLE_PREVIEW_V2       | live-alias   | yes  | no (alias)            | ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW |\n| PREVIEW_FORCE_LEGACY    | dead              | yes  | no                    | —                     |\nAUDIT_EOF'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
